      "score": 223,
      "comments": 32,
      "author": "frabonacci",
      "published": "2026-08-11T14:50:33Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Metal GPU passthrough in macOS virtual machines dramatically improves llama.cpp execution speed, achieving 11–16× higher inference throughput.",
        "Proper GPU virtualization eliminates CPU fallback bottlenecks, bringing VM-based LLM performance close to bare-metal Apple Silicon speed.",
        "Leverages Apple's Virtualization framework and llama.cpp Metal backend to enable efficient unified memory access across guest OS boundaries."
      ]
    },
